WEBVTT

00:22:59.746 --> 00:23:03.788
and women's studies. What did you think
you wanted to do professionally at that

00:23:03.788 --> 00:23:06.913
point as a poor kid getting an education?

00:23:07.579 --> 00:23:10.788
The first goal and really at first
the only goal was like,

00:23:11.079 --> 00:23:13.329
you get a job so you can make money.

00:23:13.788 --> 00:23:18.246
And I first thought that the only path
to that would be journalism.

00:23:18.288 --> 00:23:20.621
So when I was a freshman,
I majored in journalism.

00:23:20.788 --> 00:23:23.871
And when I transferred to the University
of Minnesota, I was like journalism,

00:23:24.163 --> 00:23:27.663
but I quit. I took a class really
in that first year or

00:23:27.663 --> 00:23:32.246
so with Michael Dennis Browne, the poet
Michael Dennis Browne and my eyes,